  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific 2023 Trade Policy Short Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to deliver&#xa0;Trade Policy short term training scholarships to 30 scholars from Samoa, Tonga, Niue, Tuvalu, Kiribati,&#xa0; Fiji, French Pacific, Solomon Islands and PNG.
The course will be delivered November 2023 in Auckland, by the University of Auckland&apos;s Public Policy Institute.</narrative>
